OL,3,GNEWSASouthport Inquiry hears cost
OL,4,Athwarted responses to tackling violence
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmbitious responses to tackling extreme
OL,7,Fviolence in the wake of the Southport
OL,8,Fattack were not taken forward by the
OL,9,FHome Office because of cost, a public
OL,10,Finquiry has heard.
OL,12,FThe Southport Inquiry, set up after
OL,13,Fthree girls were murdered at a dance
OL,14,Fclass in July 2024, is hearing evidence
OL,15,Fon how the risk from "violent-fixated
OL,16,Findividuals" can be managed.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
