OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASouthport Inquiry hears cost
OL,4,Athwarted responses to tackling violence
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hearing was told a Home Office unit
OL,7,Fhad identified key issues with the
OL,8,Fchallenge of non-ideological extreme
OL,9,Fviolence (NIEV) ahead of a meeting with
OL,10,Fthe cabinet secretary in June last
OL,11,Fyear.
OL,13,FFour "high ambition responses" to the
OL,14,Fissues were set out by the Home Office
OL,15,Fbut the inquiry heard all of these
OL,16,Fwould require more money to be
OL,17,Fdelivered.
